          "id": "spec001:DIALOGUE-repair-plan-menu",
          "speakerId": "narrator",
          "text": "Choose a supplied plan. Review current checks, read the warning and explicitly acknowledge it before execution. The intervention changes the path; it never performs the final measurements. Before commitment you may return to preparation with your tools. A temporary deployment and deliberate isolation each need their own written record.",
